---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Portrait from '../../components/Portrait.astro';
import Soleil from '../../components/Soleil.astro';
import Infobulles from '../../components/infobulles/Infobulles.astro';
import { LINKEDIN } from '../../i18n/textes';
---

<Base
  page="aPropos"
  langue="en"
  titre="About"
  description="Jean Perrier’s background and way of working."
>
  <div class="cadre-soleil">
  <Soleil reserve={false} />
  <article class="conteneur fiche">
    <div class="fiche__portrait"><Portrait /></div>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <Infobulles langue="en">
    <div class="fiche__texte">
      <p>
        Since 2024, I have been Head of Product at GlobalExam, a B2B SaaS scale-up in online language learning. From
        2022 to 2024, I was a Product Manager and Data Product Owner there.
      </p>
      <p>
        I lead a team of one Product Manager and two Product Designers, whom I meet one-to-one every week. I also run
        some projects myself.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before that, I built digital public services for the French government. At its digital agency (DINUM), I
        created the Observatoire de la qualité des démarches en ligne, which rates the most used online procedures. I
        also created “Je donne mon avis”, the button that collects users’ feedback at the end of a procedure. Then, at the
        interministerial directorate for public transformation (DITP), I set up Services publics&nbsp;+, where users
        share their experience and public services reply.
      </p>
      <p>
        I listen, form hypotheses, test, then build. I use AI when it meets a specific need: sorting feedback, auditing
        content, prototyping a feature.
      </p>
      <p>Educated at Sciences Po Paris (Master’s in Public Affairs). Fluent in English.</p>
      <p>Get in touch on <a href={LINKEDIN}>LinkedIn</a>.</p>
    </div>
    </Infobulles>
  </article>
  </div>
</Base>
